flowchart TD
  A[Prediction and uncertainty] --> P[Structured prompt]
  B[Clinical notes] --> P
  C[History documents] --> D[Parse or OCR]
  D --> P
  P --> E[Primary LLM]
  E -->|Unavailable| F[Fallback LLM]
  E --> G[Validate structured output]
  F --> G
  G -->|Valid| H[Pending review]
  G -->|Malformed| I[Conservative fallback]
  I --> H
  H -->|Accept| J[Saved recommendation]
  H -->|Reject| K[Discarded or regenerated]
